        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP4134, Large Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large rectangle flush door pull is for pocket doors, sliding doors, or even cabinet doors. The Deltana made Large Solid Brass Flush Pull measures 4 inches high and 1-3/4 inches wide with a total depth of 7/16 inches. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door for a contemporary and sleek look. Available in 10 great finishes, it is packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP4134-Specifications.gif?v=1704354766\" width=\"426\" height=\"220\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP4134  Large Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP4134 Large Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/8\" Thick Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish brad nails.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP4134.pdf?v=1704262160\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP4134  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
