                "title": "Large Solid Brass Flush Pull | Deltana FP4134",
                "description": "Large Cup Pull Deltna FP4134 - This large rectangle flush door pull is for pocket doors, sliding doors, or even cabinet doors. The Deltana made Large Solid Brass Flush Pull measures 4 inches high and 1-3/4 inches wide with a total depth of 7/16 inches. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door for a contemporary and sleek look. Available in 10 great  finishes, it is packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.",
